{"name":"Sable","hex":"#784841","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Sable","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Sable"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sable","blocks":[{"text":"The sable is a species of marten, a small omnivorous mammal primarily inhabiting the forest environments of Russia, from the Ural Mountains throughout Siberia, and northern Mongolia. Its habitat also borders eastern Kazakhstan, China, North Korea, and Hokkaido, Japan."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Sobol_bur.jpg/330px-Sobol_bur.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sable","wikidata":"Q26423"},{"title":"Sable (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Rena Marlette Lesnar, better known as Sable, is an American retired model, actress, and retired professional wrestler. She is best known for her tenures in World Wrestling Entertainment from 1996 to 1999, and again from 2003 to 2004."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Renamero.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sable_(wrestler)","wikidata":"Q270576"},{"title":"Sable (tincture)","blocks":[{"text":"In heraldry, sable is the tincture equivalent to black. It is one of the five dark tinctures called colours."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sable_(tincture)","wikidata":"Q936496"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Sable_area.png/500px-Sable_area.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Sable_area.png/500px-Sable_area.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASable_area.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedi